---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Support
description: Ways to support carteakey.dev and help keep the site independent.
eleventyNavigation:
  key: Support
  order: 13
---
{% include "components/breadcrumbs.njk" %}

{% set pageEyebrow = "Independent Web" %}
{% set pageTitle = "Support the site" %}
{% set pageDescription = "carteakey.dev is an independent personal site. Reading, sharing, and replying are already useful ways to support it." %}
{% include "components/page-header.njk" %}

<div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 not-prose">
  <section class="surface surface-padding">
    <p class="page-eyebrow">Direct support</p>
    <h2 class="editorial-title-compact mt-1 flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="support-coffee-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        {% feather "coffee", class="w-5 h-5" %}
        {% feather "heart", class="support-coffee-heart" %}
      </span>
      Buy the next coffee
    </h2>
    {% if support.methods.length %}
      <p class="editorial-support mt-2">
        If something here saved you time, you can leave a one-off tip.
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-4 grid gap-2">
        {% for method in support.methods %}
          <li>
            <a href="{{ method.url }}" class="support-method accent-focus" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              <span class="support-method-icon" aria-hidden="true">{% feather method.icon, class="w-5 h-5" %}</span>
              <span class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                <span class="block text-sm font-semibold">{{ method.provider }}</span>
                <span class="block text-xs editorial-support">{{ method.detail }}</span>
              </span>
              {% feather "arrow-up-right", class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0" %}
            </a>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    {% else %}
      <p class="editorial-support mt-2">
        Direct contributions are not enabled right now.
      </p>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  <section class="surface surface-padding">
    <p class="page-eyebrow">No money required</p>
    <h2 class="editorial-title-compact mt-1">Help the work travel</h2>
    <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 editorial-support list-disc pl-5">
      <li><a href="/newsletter/" class="accent-link">Subscribe to new writing</a>.</li>
      <li><a href="/feed.xml" class="accent-link">Follow the RSS feed</a>.</li>
      <li>Share a useful post with someone who would actually enjoy it.</li>
      <li><a href="/guestbook/" class="accent-link">Leave a note in the guestbook</a>.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</div>
